; Words as records. names's cards in; out a record of 17 cards for each run of cards 0 or more and the card below 0
; that ends it: that end card, how many cards the run has (n), and the run with an edge (28) on each side, padded
; with 0 to 15 cards (a word's letters and -10, a spelled letter's phonemes and -1 or -20, a punctuation card with no
; run). With every record the same size, the host can deal each beside a deck or a table record. A run has at most
; 13 cards; more are dropped. The run is kept in cells 74-88, 74 always the edge.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   c        03-25: a card of the run: kept, with the edge after it
  04                    CLA   c
  05                    TAC   end
  06                    CLA   n
  07                    SUB   n13
  08                    TAC   st
  09                    JMP   rec
  10            st      CLA   n
  11                    ADD   00
  12                    STO   n
  13                    ADD   s74
  14                    STO   wr
  15                    ADD   00
  16                    STO   we
  17                    CLA   c
  18            wr      DATA  0        (STO 74 + n)
  19                    CLA   c28
  20            we      DATA  0        (STO 75 + n)
  21                    JMP   rec
  22            end     OUT   c        22-48: the record out, and the run cleared
  23                    OUT   n
  24                    CLA   o74
  25                    STO   wo
  26            wo      DATA  0        (OUT 74 + k)
  27                    CLA   wo
  28                    ADD   00
  29                    STO   wo
  30                    SUB   o89
  31                    TAC   wo
  32                    CLA   s75
  33                    STO   wc
  34            wz      CLA   z
  35            wc      DATA  0        (STO 75 + k: 0)
  36                    CLA   wc
  37                    ADD   00
  38                    STO   wc
  39                    SUB   s89
  40                    TAC   wz
  41                    CLA   c28
  42                    STO   75
  43                    CLA   z
  44                    STO   n
  45                    JMP   rec
  50            c       DATA  0
  51            n       DATA  0
  52            z       DATA  0
  53            n13     DATA  13
  54            c28     DATA  28
  55            s74     STO   74
  56            s75     STO   75
  57            s89     STO   89
  58            o74     OUT   74
  59            o89     OUT   89
  74            w0      DATA  28
  75            w1      DATA  28
